{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128072215914-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128074250\"/><p>上水坑頭村6旬男懷兩仿製槍械被捕。</p><p>今日(28日)凌晨3時53分，上水坑頭村村民報案，指一名男子形迹可疑，懷疑携帶類似長槍的物品在村內徘徊。人員接報到場，在上址截獲該名男子，並檢獲兩把懷疑仿製槍械。經初步調查，姓梁(61歲)男子涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」被捕，他正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:04:17.463915+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:22:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T00:17:24.979817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:57:47.605560+00:00","content_hash":"22f99fdc6a1641d559bccc8ac88a45f921d17c5d1bd6b3b13b233d050d4d34ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}